Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:15.24,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's summer, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:22.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You should wear this. It's quite hot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:25.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:27.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Come on, Izumi-san, let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.91,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,We worked hard on those exams! \NNow it's time to play hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:38.48,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, we're on break! \NWhy'd you have to bring up exams?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.27,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Don't dredge up that memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.41,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, that's all on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.18,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(150.666,28)}Consecutive Failing Grades
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.53,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Be glad you only have to \Ntake supplementary lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.50,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.61,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We're gonna play our hearts out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:56.73,Main,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
