Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:30.00,Main,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an1\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\b1\fs28\shad0\3c&H1B191E&\pos(54,310)}#05  {\fs24\fscy110}Jolly Times at the River!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.49,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,The river!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:45.33,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,It's a miracle the weather's \Nthis nice when Izumi's with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.09,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,That was low-key brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:48.53,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Right, Izumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:50.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:53.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I made all those \Nteru teru bouzu dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.27,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\shad0\bord0\pos(322,281.333)}Usually Brings Rain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.57,0:02:55.28,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Are you in grade school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:57.46,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:00.69,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Let's start the barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:03.74,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten anything all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:07.22,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You're drooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.50,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're wild beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:13.33,Main,Inu/Neko,0,0,0,,Chow time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll leave the vegetables here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:18.51,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:22.89,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I held out until this meat was \Non sale at the grocery store!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.46,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, that looks tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:26.77,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,More praise, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:30.78,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We borrowed everything we'd need\Nand we have all our food, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:32.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why don't we divide up the prep work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.23,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Heck, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:45.64,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Why'd you volunteer yourself to cut \Nvegetables with {\i1}those{\i0} knife skills?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.74,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I thought I could do it if I tried...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.18,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,So says the defendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.38,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Knock that off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:54.90,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We'll handle this! You just sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:56.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let me help, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.17,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That's an even worse idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:00.20,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Are we in Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.10,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Izumi! Don't do anything rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.21,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Please, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.45,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Izumi, you can cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:27.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I help my mom a lot, so I can \Nprobably make just about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:31.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:36.98,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Wait, Izumi, if you can cook that well, \Nshouldn't girls be falling all over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:40.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please don't say weird things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:41.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you after him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:45.23,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Why are you getting all \Ncompetitive toward {\i1}me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:19.74,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Let's put some more on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.50,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:38.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,That sound is making my mouth water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.91,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Think they're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.97,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Not yet. Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:50.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:55.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san, please have this if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:57.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ajillo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.78,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I made it just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:03.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! It looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:06.66,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,No fair, Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.74,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.04,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Irresistible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:15.18,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san really can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:18.98,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-Is there something wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:21.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It just looks so good, \NI was at a loss for words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:25.43,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll try it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:31.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I mean, she's cute, she's smart, \Nshe's athletic, {\i0}and{\i1} she can cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:35.33,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san is perfect in every single...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:37.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:43.30,Main,Inu/Neko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:47.28,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this? It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:50.01,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And it's bitter. No... Sweet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:54.85,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's so intense that I thought my tongue \Nwas exploding right out of my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:58.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,H-Huh? Does it really taste that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:06.59,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I guess she's not so good \Nat cooking after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.33,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I've got tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:09.56,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Need some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:11.07,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,There's juice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.72,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:26.95,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please spit that out! It could be deadly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:33.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You put your all into making this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:37.81,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I get seasonings wrong all the time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:45.69,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Please, body... hold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:51.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll learn how to make delicious meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:53.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:59.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:00.25,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.54,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.22,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.05,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,He's still glutting himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.35,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Growth spurts are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:17.61,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hmm... Anyone else feel like something sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.61,0:08:19.75,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Did we bring any dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:20.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:24.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I made s'mores from the snacks we brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.85,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,S'mores?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:30.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You toast a marshmallow and sandwich it \Nbetween crackers and chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:32.62,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Who came up with this work of art?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.07,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Thank you, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:36.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:40.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I really wanted you to try these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I'll try one right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.46,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You ate too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:56.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:58.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:08:59.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I could eat these every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,G-G... Glad to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:13.15,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,"Every day," she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.16,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Shameless!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:17.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sh-She didn't mean it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:18.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Right, Shikimori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:21.49,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:23.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Stop teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.50,Italics,Neko/Hachi,0,0,0,,She's a devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:28.63,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Man, I'm stuffed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:34.55,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Okay, everything's cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.37,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:37.96,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,All right, let's hit that river!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.28,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:44.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,About before...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:45.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Next time, let's have them\N with just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:56.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:07.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.24,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's nice, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:11.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:16.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Is something wrong, Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:20.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,N-No! I was just thinking \Nabout how relaxing the river is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:26.75,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.29,Main,Child 1,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:29.53,Main,Child 2,0,0,0,,A giant shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:32.12,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,The kids are loving it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.91,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Where were you even keeping that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:36.36,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Just swim like a normal person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.57,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess I'll leave it to the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.65,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Don't put it in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.50,Main,Children,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:47.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow, I guess some modern swimsuits are \Nmade to look like Western clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:48.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I guess so!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.79,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Come on in, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:57.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-Izumi-san, let's go join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:57.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:07.70,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,All that aside, the river's so nice and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.50,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I should thank everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:13.99,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Even the kids here are having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The current's taking her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:26.83,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:30.70,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,So when's the big reveal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:33.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Well, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:37.09,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You bought it just for your bae, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:43.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I... I don't think... I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.81,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Izumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:04.21,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:08.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hi there—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! D-Don't get violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:17.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's go back to your mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:27.07,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,See? Nothing to be scared of anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:30.61,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm not a great swimmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:33.79,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but I have to get her back to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.65,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Can you reach?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:39.71,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:56.09,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.17,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,Mister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.93,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.26,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:13.23,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.02,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:19.93,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,That guy... He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:26.98,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Wh-What do we do?! \NShould we call someone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.88,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My foot cramped up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:41.67,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, this is really bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:45.95,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I... can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:59.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.31,0:14:03.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Everything's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.04,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:17.65,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why didn't you call for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:31.35,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You guys! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:36.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God you're both okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:38.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the river! It'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:40.05,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,If you're hurt, say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:42.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.31,Main,Mom,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:47.13,Main,Mom,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry this happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:48.56,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,M-Ma'am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.57,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.69,0:15:00.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry. Did I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:01.84,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.50,Main,Little Girl,0,0,0,,You were really cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thank you... You're so kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:17.02,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,All right! Back to the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:21.59,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, cheer up! She's just a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:24.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll swim, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.07,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Are you insane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:27.35,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,He bounces back quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.35,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.35,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:38.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:41.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:46.92,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Neko, there's a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:48.75,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:49.73,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.74,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:03.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:05.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Your swimsuit is really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:06.68,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:09.03,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnArial\fry-20\shad0\frz6\b1\pos(213.333,87.333)\3c&HEFECEC&\c&HA7A19F&}Konjac\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSouvenirs\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&HA79FC1&}Miso Pickles\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H84778A&}Miso-Preserved Pork\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\3c&HD3D0D6&}Boy Choy\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&HBB96A7&}Manjuu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.13,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:19.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:21.86,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.75,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.667,142)\fnArial\b1\fs18\shad0\bord1\c&HEEF0F0&\3c&HC6969D&}Baron of Local Specialties
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:28.76,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That suits you so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:32.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks for picking it out \Nfor me, Hachimitsu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.73,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Stop. You'll make me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:37.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What's going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:42.77,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fay-.08\pos(308,64.667)\c&HC296F8&\3c&HFCEEFF&\4c&HBC97C7&}GELATO
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:42.77,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\fay-.07\c&HD1C6F1&\3c&H746484&\shad0\bord1\4c&HBC97C7&\pos(323.333,132.667)}Made with milk from local dairy farmers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:42.77,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs18\fay-.02\pos(348,332)\shad0\c&HF39CA6&\3c&HFFF2F9&}20 Flavors of Gelato
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.32,0:16:39.64,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It's an ice cream shop.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.03,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Oh, they've got gelato!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.03,0:16:42.76,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Looks pretty popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:45.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's go get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:49.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Where's everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:51.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,They're still waiting in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It is pretty busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:55.28,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We had to wait quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:58.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yours looks good, too. What flavor is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:04.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think it was... mocha almond, if I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do you want a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:11.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Can I? I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.16,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:26.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.60,0:17:32.43,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Then I'll try yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.16,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Nom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.82,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,My... My ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No, that was mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:02.84,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Sorry, man! Here, you can have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:04.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:13.86,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you, a little kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:23.41,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an4\3c&HF5D3BA&\shad0\bord1\c&HF5F2EF&}Throb
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:23.41,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an6\c&HF5D3BA&\shad0\bord1\3c&HF5F2EF&}Throb
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:21.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:23.40,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} took damage from that, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.80,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Gimme! Gimme! Gimme!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:27.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Who's the little kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:29.60,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}My ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:29.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Guys, we're in high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:31.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}How dare you eat Izumi-san's?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:31.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is ice cream worth all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:34.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Grudges over food are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.80,0:18:36.96,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Ice cream is truly sinful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:40.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Mm, this is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:46.62,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Time flies, huh? How is it so late already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:49.30,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Man, I played like crazy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.04,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Ready to head home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.04,0:18:53.13,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,No! Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:55.47,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,The real world awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.58,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,The place is all ours! Let's grab seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:04.91,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It sure is hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:06.58,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Wanna open a window?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:14.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The sweetfish was delicious, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.87,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Look. This was you eating sweetfish, Inu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:20.43,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Don't drop the "zuka."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:24.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The line for the ice cream sure was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:25.51,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.51,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Wait, is Hachimitsu asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:30.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Is she breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.09,0:19:31.60,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:36.55,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. I just dozed off for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:38.48,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Mph... Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:48.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,All three of them are asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:52.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes... they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:54.00,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow, she's spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.45,0:19:56.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You can sleep, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:13.40,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:16.56,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,G-Gotta think about something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:18.91,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Um... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.81,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Today sure was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.81,0:20:24.07,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I caused everyone a lot of stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:26.42,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but it was nice to play \Nto our hearts' content.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:30.03,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Going shopping was fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:31.80,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And the cucumbers were great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:36.16,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I hope Mom and Dad like the \Nsouvenirs I got for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This really was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:49.55,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And I guess that's because \NI was with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:53.25,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to be friends them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:56.02,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,and that I met Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:21:00.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm really... so glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:09.30,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:50.36,Main,Izumi/Hachi,0,0,0,,Can't walk any more...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:52.24,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,The indoorsy types are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:54.81,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
